 {id:'ie',title:'Suspected infective endocarditis',aliases:['ie','endocarditis','vegetation','infective endocarditis','bacteraemia','bacteremia'],aim:'Assess lesions, valve damage and haemodynamic consequences.',refs:['ie'],views:['plax','a4c','a3c'],caution:'A negative TTE does not exclude endocarditis. High suspicion, prostheses or incomplete imaging need physician-led TEE / further imaging. Escalate destructive lesions or haemodynamic compromise.',items:[
